<title>UK: S&amp;P rates Petronas Samurai bond A plus l-term.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P rates Petronas Samurai bond A plus l-term.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said on Monday it has assigned its A plus long-term foreign currency rating to Petroliam Nasional Berhad 's Japanese 22 billion yen Samurai bond issue under two tranches.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 6176</p>
